  "hints": [
    "Rewrite |2x| < 5 as −5 < 2x < 5 and divide by 2.",
    "Which integers lie strictly between −2.5 and 2.5?"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "|2x| < 5 means −5/2 < x < 5/2, so the elements are the integers −2 through 2.",
    "So the answer is $\\{-2, -1, 0, 1, 2\\}$."
  ],
